     A                                      COLHDG('NON-VEH TYPE FLAG')
     A* A RECORD UNDER THIS STATUS REPRESENTS ONE OF THE FOLLOWING
     A* 1= NON OWNED VEHICLES
     A* 2= HIRED VEHICLES
     A* 3= DRIVE OTHER VEHICLES
     A            VSSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            VSUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            VSPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            VSTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            VSDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A            VSNU      R               REFFLD(FLAG)
